        "title": "Apply the law of logarithms for powers",
        "text": "$$3\\log_7(x-1)+2\\log_7(x+1)-\\log_7(x**2-1)=\\log_7\\left((x-1)**3\\right)+\\log_7\\left((x+1)**2\\right)-\\log_7(x**2-1).$$",
