        "title": "Apply the law of logarithms for products",
        "text": "$$\\log_7\\left((x-1)**3\\right)+\\log_7\\left((x+1)**2\\right)-\\log_7(x**2-1)=\\log_7\\left((x-1)**3(x+1)**2\\right)-\\log_7(x**2-1)$$",
